{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I now have all the pieces. Let me verify the logic:\n\n1. **The award created in the 2000s**: The International Booker Prize was established in 2005 (confirmed in e2 and search results). However, the question's phrasing \"the very award above for which the first book was later in contention\" — Chigozie Obioma's novels were shortlisted for the **Booker Prize** (not the International Booker Prize). The Booker Prize was established in 1969, not the 2000s.\n\nWait — let me reconsider. The question says \"originally created in the 2000s (the award itself).\" This is a constraint on the award. The Booker Prize (1969) doesn't fit. But the Man Booker International Prize (2005) does fit the \"2000s\" creation. However, Obioma's books were shortlisted for the regular Booker Prize, not the International Booker Prize.\n\nLet me reconsider the timeline more carefully. The question says: \"In the 2010s, the year in which this book was published, another book, which had been released the preceding year, won the very award above for which the first book was later in contention.\"\n\n- \"An Orchestra of Minorities\" published 2019, shortlisted for 2019 Booker Prize\n- 2019 Booker Prize won by \"The Testaments\" (Atwood) and \"Girl, Woman, Other\" (Evaristo)\n- \"Girl, Woman, Other\" was published May 2019; \"The Testaments\" published September 2019\n\nThe \"released the preceding year\" doesn't fit 2019 books. Let me check \"The Fishermen\" (2015) instead. The 2015 Booker Prize was won by \"A Brief History of Seven Killings\" by Marlon James. Let me verify the publication dates and Marlon James's birthplace.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"A Brief History of Seven Killings Marlon James publication date 2014 Booker Prize 2015\", \"Marlon James born Kingston Jamaica biography\", \"The Fishermen Chigozie Obioma publication date 2015 Booker shortlist\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_36a27b41abf44a198368dec6","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789476867,"id":"chatcmpl-c4aa4937-341e-917f-ba0f-7d6cc884400a","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":17169,"completion_tokens":459,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":17628,"cached_tokens":3328,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3328},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}